      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Real),Type.annotation(@Y,Real),Type.annotation(@Z,Real),Ne[authored_Neq_default](,VecNotation[default](X,Y,Z),LA.Zero[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$)))),def(AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane.homogeneousCoordinates(X,Y,Z),AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane,Quotient.mk[default](Set.Elem[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$),Set.diff[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$),Set.univ[typed](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$)),Set.singleton[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$),LA.Zero[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$))))),AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane.Proportional,VecNotation[default](X,Y,Z))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Every nonzero triple $(X,Y,Z)$ determines a point of $\\mathbb{P}^2_{\\mathbb{R}}$, namely its class $[X:Y:Z]$. The ratio $X:Y:Z$ is the **homogeneous coordinate** of that point, and $(X,Y,Z)$ is a representative triple of it. Homogeneous coordinates are thus defined up to multiplication by a nonzero scalar.",
          "zh-CN": "每个非零三元组 $(X,Y,Z)$ 都确定 $\\mathbb{P}^2_{\\mathbb{R}}$ 的一个点，即其等价类 $[X:Y:Z]$。比 $X:Y:Z$ 就是该点的**齐次坐标**，$(X,Y,Z)$ 是它的一个代表三元组。因此齐次坐标在同乘非零标量下不变。"
        }
      }
